Example 11.9: symbolic constant n is just another column  (vars: n i )
    i >= 0
    n - i >= 0

---- n = -10 ----
  guard n >= 0: FALSE
  for (i = 0; i <= n; i++) with n = -10: 0 iterations
  integer points with n = -10 (brute force): 0  == loop

---- n = 10 ----
  guard n >= 0: true
  for (i = 0; i <= n; i++) with n = 10: 11 iterations
  integer points with n = 10 (brute force): 11  == loop
